The sans of the Llama family, with Mono below and Serif to follow. A neo-grotesk with an even stroke, round bowls and open, angle-cut terminals, in one variable font from {axis.min} to {axis.max} with an optical size axis: Display at its large end for headlines, UI at its small end for interfaces and running text.

